Subject: Remove sites on ntp

Lumo (build #10): preimage rewritten for a tree WITHOUT domain
substitution. The original patch expected the substituted
(qjz9zk) URLs in default_popular_sites.json, which made it fail
once substitution was filtered/removed (build #9 prep failure).
The resulting file is byte-identical to the original patch's
result: the default popular-site entries are removed, leaving
only Ungoogled Chromium, freenode, Chrome Flags and Chrome Version.

